@startuml libtetrisbrain_character_abilities

!theme plain

skinparam backgroundColor #FFF9FC
skinparam defaultFontName "Avenir Next"
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 14
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #756A83
  ArrowThickness 1.6
  ParticipantBorderColor #8B7E9F
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  ParticipantFontColor #40364D
  LifeLineBorderColor #C8BFD3
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #F3EDF7
  GroupBorderColor #C8BFD3
  GroupBackgroundColor #FFFDFE
  GroupHeaderFontColor #604978
  NoteBorderColor #9FC5A7
  NoteBackgroundColor #E8F5E9
  NoteFontColor #3F6848
  DividerBackgroundColor #F0E7FA
  DividerBorderColor #B69ACF
  DividerFontColor #604978
}

title <size:22><b>libtetrisbrain Character Abilities</b></size>\n<size:14>Pure Battle Royale board transforms</size>

participant "Ability Request\nor Game Event" as Input #DDF3F5
participant "Game Server\n(tetrisd)" as Server #F9E2DC
participant "Ability Logic\n(abilities.c)" as Brain #E9E2F7
participant "Caller-owned\nTarget Board" as Board #DFF3E4

== 1. Resolve the ability ==

Input -> Server: Activate character ability
Server -> Server: Resolve character, level, and target
Server -> Server: Lock target room mutex

note over Server, Brain
tetrisd owns targeting, charges, cooldowns, and locking.
libtetrisbrain only applies the selected board transform.
end note

== 2. Apply the character transform ==

alt Wolfman - Cut Top
  Server -> Brain: board_cut_top(board, n)
  Brain -> Board: Remove top n rows, shift stack up,\nclear vacated bottom rows
else Wolfman Level 4 - Gravity
  Server -> Brain: board_apply_gravity(board)
  Brain -> Board: Drop suspended cells to the bottom\nof each column
else Mirurun - Cut Bottom
  Server -> Brain: board_cut_bottom(board, n)
  Brain -> Board: Remove bottom n rows, shift stack down,\nclear vacated top rows
else Halloween - Dark
  Server -> Brain: board_invert(board)
  Brain -> Board: Empty becomes garbage;\nfilled or garbage becomes empty
else Halloween - Burn
  Server -> Brain: board_fill_rows(board, n, hole_col)
  Brain -> Board: Overwrite bottom n rows with garbage,\nleaving the selected hole
else Halloween - Bomb
  Server -> Brain: board_clear_cells(board, cols, rows, count)
  Brain -> Board: Clear only the selected cells
else Princess - Laser
  Server -> Brain: board_delete_columns(board, start, end)
  Brain -> Board: Clear the inclusive column range\nacross every row
end

Brain --> Server: Transform complete

note over Brain, Board #FFF3CD
All functions mutate the caller-owned t_board in place and return void.
Invalid sizes are ignored or clamped; out-of-range cell targets are ignored.
end note

== 3. Publish the result ==

Server -> Server: Copy authoritative state for broadcast
Server -> Server: Unlock target room mutex
Server --> Input: Send updated STATE

@enduml
